70","kind":"announcement","title":"PvP MODE IS NOW LIVE!","summary":"The machine is running again — and this time, you’re not the only one trapped in the room.Our new PvP Playtest is now live!Get matched with another player, build your setup, and beat their score in 3 spins. Win the duel, claim a cigarette butt, and climb the leaderboard.Yes, cigarette butts are your ranked points here.How to JoinVisit the DEAD SPIN Steam page no key needed, instant accessDownload the playtest and pull the leverShare your feedback and bug reports in our Discord or the Steam Discu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-29T17:38:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951306058","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3705670-1837955055356335","game_id":"steam-3705670","kind":"announcement","title":"Slots are spinning: 500+ Playtesters, 1000+ Wishlists!","summary":"Wakey, wakey, lucky players! Slots are spinning, and you’re not the only one strapped in – over 500 players have already taken a seat at the machine, and we’ve passed 1000 wishlists on Steam! Thanks to everyone who decided to sit down, pull the lever, and see what the reels had in mind for them.In the first days of the playtest, more than 500 players have already taken a seat at the slot-machine and we’ve passed 1000 wishlists on Steam! Huge thanks to everyone who decided to risk a first spin. I","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-10T10:01:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055356335","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3705670-1836506165581171","game_id":"steam-3705670","kind":"announcement","title":"OPEN PLAYTEST ANNOUNCEMENT","summary":"You have been selected.No keys. No way out. Just a slot machine, a chair, and someone watching from the other side. The DEAD SPIN public playtest is now open.🎰 It runs from July 8, 16:00 UTC until July 19, and anyone can take a seat. Just hit the “Request Access” button on the Steam page, step inside, and start spinning. This playtest build includes:A short tutorial before the first real spin4 opponents, each with their own tricks, skills, and bad intentionsUnlockable items for different builds ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-08T16:30:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165581171","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3705670-1836506165581080","game_id":"steam-3705670","kind":"announcement","title":"DEAD SPIN ANNOUNCEMENT","summary":"🎉Welcome to our grand opening!Hope you enjoy playing slots and tense duels – this place is full of both. 😈🎰What is DEAD SPIN?DEAD SPIN is a roguelike deckbuilder where every run is a series of high‑stakes spins.You assemble a deck of symbols, plug them into a deadly slot machine, and try to outscore your opponents.Your job is to turn that chaos into a strategy before the machine grinds you down.🕹️Full game key featuresDeadly duels on slot-machineRoguelike with meta-progression based on unlockabl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-08T16:00:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165581080","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3705670":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:28Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:28Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3705670":"2026-10-26T00:44:28Z"},"notices":[],"n